<ContentPage title="Contact us" description="Have a question, found a problem, or have an idea for a useful tool? We’d be glad to hear from you." eyebrow="Contact">
  <section><h2>Get in touch</h2><p>Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@zyvento.io">hello@zyvento.io</a>. Please include the page or feature you are referring to and a short description of your question.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Useful details to include</h2><ul><li>The URL where you noticed the issue.</li><li>The device and browser you were using.</li><li>The steps that led to the problem.</li><li>A screenshot when it helps explain what happened.</li></ul></section>
  <section><h2>Response times</h2><p>We aim to review messages carefully and reply when a response is needed. Please do not send passwords, payment details, or other sensitive information by email.</p></section>
</ContentPage>
